    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/58-brecan-close-balbriggan-dublin-k32ed27\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 58 Brecan Close, Balbriggan.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of Balbriggan, this is a charming semi-detached residence. The exterior of this tidy property offers ample parking to the front and features a sunny south-facing orientation, enhancing the aesthetic appeal and providing abundant light throughout the day. The property is fitted with double glazed PVC windows for optimal insulation and comfort.\r\n\r\nAs you enter through the enclosed entryway, you're welcomed into a spacious and inviting living area. This room is a perfect blend of modern efficiency and charm, highlighted by an open fireplace that serves as a focal point. The property is equipped with smart energy-efficient electric radiators, ensuring cosy warmth during the cooler months. The kitchen is adorned with high-quality smart appliances. The clever layout optimises space and functionality, seamlessly integrating with the dining area.\r\n\r\nThe upstairs accommodation comprises a generous bedroom, providing a serene retreat with ample storage. The bright, spacious room is well-proportioned, perfect for relaxing. The bathroom is conveniently located and maintains a fresh and modern appeal, with contemporary fittings and fixtures visible in the images provided.\r\n\r\nLocated centrally, this property is ideal for commuters, being just a short walk from Balbriggan railway station and well-served bus stops. In close proximity to local schools, sports clubs, and essential amenities, it provides a balanced blend of convenience and community charm.\r\n\r\nWith its strategic town-centre location, 58 Brecan Close is particularly suited for first-time buyers looking to step onto the property ladder or investors seeking a rental opportunity in a prime location. Its practical design and modern amenities make it a wise and attractive investment."
      },
